<style>
    p {
        margin-top: 0px;
        margin-bottom: 0px;
    }
</style>
<body class="setupTab" onload="init()" style="background-color: #FFFFFF; bEditID: b1st1; bLabel: body;">
<table cellpadding="0" width="500" cellspacing="0" id="topTable" height="450">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r1st1; blabel: header; vertical-align: top; height: 95; text-align: left;"><img border="0" beditid="r1sp1" blabel="headerImage" id="r1sp1" src="http://c.na12.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015U0000003sxfg&amp;oid=00DU0000000YT3c" /></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r2st1; blabel: accent1; height: 0;"></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td styleinsert="1" height="300" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top" height="400">
<td teditid="c1r1" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0">
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">歡迎訪問Intel客戶支援服務請求管理系統！</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">請保留這封電子郵件以便未來參考使用。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>登入 ID：</b>!%UserUserName%!</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>電子郵件地址：</b>!%UserEmailAddr%! </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">請將您的密碼當作機密保護。 您對於密碼與 Intel 網站的使用，必須遵守 Intel 的使用條款與條件，您可透過個別網站網頁最下方的連結進入。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">如果您有任何問題，請在<a href="http://http://www.intel.com/p/zh_TW/support">這裡</a>與我們聯繫。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">造訪此<a href="http://https://!%tst_us_en%!">連結</a>可隨時管理您的基本資料。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">請勿回覆此電子郵件訊息。 這是自動化回應。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">為確保您可以繼續收到我們的電子郵件，請將我們加到您的通訊錄。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">Intel 承諾保護您的隱私權。 如需更多資訊，</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">請參閱 Intel 隱私權通知。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"><a href="http://http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html">法律聲明</a> | <a href="http://http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/trademarks.html">商標</a> © Intel Corporation。 版權所有。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">*其他名稱與品牌可能業經宣告為他人之財產。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">**Intel 對本公司內部網路以外的網站內容，概不負責。 </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
